e\n- `.github/codeql/codeql-config.yml:1-10` — Preserve `docs/**` is excluded because it is non-shipping prose/experiments; default query suite unchanged. Consumer: CodeQL maintainers.\n- `.github/dependabot.yml:1-29` — Preserve PRs are advisory because Gerrit lands code; enabled ecosystems; major-version ignore and its removal condition. Consumer: Dependabot/GitHub maintainers.\n- `.github/pull_request_template.md:1-6` — Preserve at most a short hidden routing reminder. Consumer: GitHub PR form.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":".github/codeql/codeql-config.yml","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":".github/dependabot.yml","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":".github/pull_request_template.md","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","49ac-d7e5-f383-4d7f"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"49ac-d7e5-f383-4d7f","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediatio